AI ENGINEER INTERVIEW MASTER ROADMAP

Goal

Build first-principles understanding of AI engineering.

Focus on concepts needed by an AI Engineer, LLM Engineer, and GenAI Engineer, rather than an ML researcher.

Every major concept should be learned through:

1. First principles
2. Intuition
3. Internal mechanism
4. Mathematical understanding where useful
